      "extract_value": "This abstract describes two studies (Ns = 238, 288) that developed and validated the Caregiver Eating Messages Scale, which includes restrictive/critical messages and pressure to eat messages. Both factors were positively related to women's BMI, and restrictive/critical messages were positively related to men's BMI. The messages also predicted body attitudes and disordered eating, with restrictive/critical messages uniquely predicting men's body appreciation.",
